# Dated backups of the previous graph, created on every `graphify update`
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
# Machine-specific: absolute interpreter path + local cost tracker
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/cost.json